2,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that keeps the door open for newcomers without exposing everyone's private costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Before we pick a fee, we must ensure the next treasurer isn't buried in administrative work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The current system hides how uneven the actual participation is among our members.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,People are hesitating to commit to evenings; the fee structure is making them overthink it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess next year's costs. We need hard data on what we can actually count on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the admin load is too high, does that push us toward a simpler flat fee?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, not necessarily. A flat fee simplifies collection, but activity tracking still requires effort.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, is the hesitation about the money, or about feeling obligated to show up?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, it is the obligation. If it feels like a transaction, they stop coming.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, what specific records would tell us if the current collection method is failing?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I worry that tiered options might make the quieter members feel excluded or judged.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. We need to look at the hours logged by the last treasurer to see the real cost.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I want to see the sign-in sheets. Who is actually here, and who is just paying?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,The winter social feedback is key. Why are the regulars pulling back now?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I need the bank statements. If people are asking to spread payments, our cash flow is weak.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's look at the taster forms too. Why do people stop after the first night?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. The ledger will show our fixed costs, which don't change with attendance.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the rota against attendance. It seems the same few people do everything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the mid-year joiners. How hard is it to add them to the system?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I will check the ledger and the bank statements. We need to know the baseline.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
