60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A, the flat fee, protects the newcomers and keeps the social fabric intact.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the only one that keeps the treasurer's workload manageable. I support it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option B, tiered, might address the inequity, but the history of friction makes me wary.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C, activity-based, is too transactional. It kills the sense of belonging.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option A is the most stable for our cash flow. I will vote for it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, if we choose A, we accept that the active members are subsidizing the quiet ones.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, yes, but that is the price of keeping the club open and accessible to everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, do you think the quiet members would prefer a lower tier if it existed?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, they prefer not to be categorized. They just want to come in without feeling judged.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the bank data supports A. Fewer reminders, cleaner books.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am convinced. The social cost of C is too high, and B is too risky.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The administrative burden of C is unsustainable for the next treasurer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will vote for A, but I hope we find a way to recognize the active members' effort.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,A is the only option that preserves the culture we have built.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,Final vote. I am confident in A.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's proceed to the vote.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
